<div class="machine-story project-section" data-source-frame="1277:14558">
  <section class="project-copy" aria-label="Concept"><h2 class="eyebrow">The concept</h2>
    <p>A gin label for Publicis Machine developed through typography, material and experimentation. The bottle becomes more than a container: it changes how the identity is seen.</p>
  </section>

  <figure class="wordmark"><img src="/assets/parity/1277-14558-1ad68.png" alt="Publicis Machine wordmark" width="280" height="280" /></figure>

  <div class="machine-video machine-video-main">
